This repository holds MOCK SAMPLE DATA. It exists for one purpose: to populate
the public product pages on https://daasfactory.live so a visitor can see the
shape of a DaaSFac data pack before deciding to obtain the real one. It is a
display fixture, not a free tier and not a preview edition.

No open-source licence is granted. This file is the only licence in effect.


